<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0f141c">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Eko-Bürokrat">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="images/icon-192.png">
  <title>Eko-Bürokrat: Çevre Şehircilik Müdürlüğü</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Courier+Prime:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@600;700;800&family=Cinzel:wght@700;800;900&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@1,700;1,900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #0f141c;
      --paper-cream: #fdfcf7;
      --paper-border: #ded7c8;
      --paper-ink: #0f172a;
      
      --stat-budget: #eab308;
      --stat-eco: #10b981;
      --stat-youth: #38bdf8;
      --stat-mayor: #f43f5e;
      
      --stamp-green: #047857;
      --stamp-red: #b91c1c;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      user-select: none;
      -webkit-user-select: none;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg-dark);
      color: #f1f5f9;
      height: 100vh;
      width: 100vw;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    /* ============================================================
       TOP FLOATING HUD: MUNICIPAL DASHBOARD
       ============================================================ */
    .top-floating-hud {
      position: fixed;
      top: 10px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 96%;
      max-width: 1024px;
      z-index: 50;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 8px 18px;
      background: rgba(15, 20, 28, 0.9);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    }

    .hud-title {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .hud-title span {
      color: #34d399;
    }

    /* 4 Stat Indicators in HUD */
    .hud-stats-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .stat-pill {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      min-width: 64px;
    }

    .stat-pill-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      font-size: 10.5px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .stat-floating-delta {
      position: absolute;
      top: -20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(0);
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }

    .stat-floating-delta.animate-pos {
      color: #34d399;
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(-10px);
    }

    .stat-floating-delta.animate-neg {
      color: #f87171;
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(-10px);
    }

    .stat-pill-track {
      width: 100%;
      height: 5px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border-radius: 999px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .stat-pill-fill {
      height: 100%;
      width: 50%;
      border-radius: 999px;
      transition: width 0.4s ease;
    }

    .fill-b { background: var(--stat-budget); }
    .fill-e { background: var(--stat-eco); }
    .fill-y { background: var(--stat-youth); }
    .fill-m { background: var(--stat-mayor); }

    .stat-pill-val {
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .hud-right-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .badge-calendar {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .badge-calendar strong {
      color: #38bdf8;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .sound-toggle-btn {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      color: #e2e8f0;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 11px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    
    /* ============================================================
       TOP SLIDING INCOMING CALL BANNER (MOBILE & DESKTOP)
       ============================================================ */
    .incoming-call-banner {
      position: fixed;
      top: -120px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 94%;
      max-width: 480px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b2e 0%, #450a0a 100%);
      border: 2px solid #ef4444;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.6), 0 0 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      z-index: 9999;
      transition: top 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .incoming-call-banner.active {
      top: 14px;
      animation: bannerBounce 1.2s infinite ease-in-out alternate;
    }

    @keyframes bannerBounce {
      0% { transform: translateX(-50%) scale(0.98); }
      100% { transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1.02); }
    }

    .call-banner-avatar-wrap {
      position: relative;
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      margin-right: 10px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .call-banner-avatar {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2px solid #ef4444;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .call-banner-pulse {
      position: absolute;
      inset: -4px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2px solid #ef4444;
      animation: pulseRing 1s ease-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulseRing {
      0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
      100% { transform: scale(1.5); opacity: 0; }
    }

    .call-banner-text {
      flex: 1;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .call-banner-title {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #fca5a5;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }

    .call-banner-sub {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #fef08a;
      font-weight: 700;
      animation: pulseHint 1s ease infinite alternate;
    }

    .call-banner-btn-answer {
      background: #22c55e;
      color: #052e16;
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-weight: 900;
      padding: 9px 15px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.5);
      white-space: nowrap;
      animation: answerPulse 0.8s infinite alternate;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    @keyframes answerPulse {
      0% { transform: scale(1); }
      100% { transform: scale(1.08); }
    }

    /* Dual Artwork Display */
    .desktop-only { display: block; }
    .mobile-only { display: none; }

    /* Default Desktop / Landscape Styles */
    .office-stage {
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
      max-width: 1536px;
      max-height: 1024px;
      aspect-ratio: 1536 / 1024;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
    }

    .window-viewport {
      position: absolute;
      top: 15.14%;
      left: 25.72%;
      width: 49.48%;
      height: 31.25%;
      overflow: hidden;
      z-index: 1;
      background: #090e15;
    }

    .office-artwork {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
      z-index: 5;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .desk-hotline {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 22%;
      right: 21%;
      z-index: 20;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
    }

    .desk-hotline:hover {
      transform: scale(1.15);
    }

    .hotline-phone-icon {
      font-size: 38px;
      line-height: 1;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.8));
    }

    .desk-hotline.ringing {
      animation: phoneRing 0.28s ease infinite alternate;
    }

    @keyframes phoneRing {
      0% { transform: rotate(-12deg) scale(1.1); }
      100% { transform: rotate(12deg) scale(1.25); }
    }

    .phone-urgent-banner {
      position: absolute;
      top: -22px;
      background: #ef4444;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 2px solid #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.95);
      white-space: nowrap;
      display: none;
      animation: pulseBanner 0.7s ease infinite alternate;
    }

    .desk-hotline.ringing .phone-urgent-banner {
      display: block;
    }

    .paper-desk-slot {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 3%;
      left: 26%;
      width: 48%;
      height: 26%;
      min-width: 380px;
      max-width: 580px;
      z-index: 25;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    /* ============================================================
       MOBILE PORTRAIT ENGINE (Designer(12).png 1024x1536)
       ============================================================ */
    @media (max-width: 768px), (orientation: portrait) {
      .desktop-only { display: none !important; }
      .mobile-only { display: block !important; }

      .office-stage {
        max-width: 100vw;
        max-height: 100vh;
        width: 100vw;
        height: 100vh;
        aspect-ratio: 1024 / 1536;
        background: #090e15;
      }

      /* Mobile 3-pane Window Viewport matching Designer(12).png */
      .window-viewport {
        top: 19.21%;
        left: 24.41%;
        width: 56.15%;
        height: 22.46%;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }

      /* Mobile Desk Hotline */
      .desk-hotline {
        top: 61%;
        right: 6%;
        bottom: auto;
        z-index: 35;
      }

      .hotline-phone-icon {
        font-size: 36px;
      }

      /* Mobile Paper Slot on Leather Desk Mat */
      .paper-desk-slot {
        top: 68%;
        bottom: 1.5%;
        left: 4%;
        width: 92%;
        height: auto;
        min-width: unset;
        max-width: unset;
        z-index: 25;
      }

      .official-dossier {
        height: 100%;
        max-height: calc(32vh);
        padding: 8px 12px 8px;
      }

      .gov-header-title { font-size: 10.5px; }
      .gov-header-dept { font-size: 8.5px; }
      .petitioner-photo { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
      .memo-meta-grid { font-size: 8.5px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
      .memo-subject-bold { font-size: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 3px; }
      .memo-content p { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.32; }
      .memo-footer { font-size: 8px; margin-top: 2px; }

      .btn-action {
        padding: 8px 12px;
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      .onboarding-hint {
        top: -22px;
        font-size: 9.5px;
      }

      /* Compact Mobile HUD */
      .top-floating-hud {
        top: 4px;
        padding: 5px 8px;
        width: 96%;
        border-radius: 12px;
      }

      .hud-title { display: none; }
      .hud-stats-group { gap: 6px; }
      .stat-pill { min-width: 42px; }
      .stat-pill-header { font-size: 9px; }
      .stat-pill-track { width: 40px; height: 4px; }
      .stat-pill-val { font-size: 8.5px; }

      .badge-calendar { font-size: 9.5px; padding: 2px 5px; }
      .sound-toggle-btn { font-size: 9px; padding: 2px 5px; }
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Top Sliding Call Notification (100% Reliable for Phone & Desktop) -->
  <div class="incoming-call-banner" id="incomingCallBanner">
    <div class="call-banner-avatar-wrap">
      <img src="images/baskan.png" class="call-banner-avatar" alt="Başkan">
      <span class="call-banner-pulse"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="call-banner-text">
      <div class="call-banner-title">BELEDİYE BAŞKANI CENGİZ BEY</div>
      <div class="call-banner-sub">⚠️ Kriptolu Acil Makam Çağrısı...</div>
    </div>
    <button class="call-banner-btn-answer" id="btnAnswerBanner">
      📞 CEVAPLA
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- ============================================================
       TOP FLOATING HUD: MUNICIPAL DASHBOARD TABLET
       ============================================================ */ -->
  <header class="top-floating-hud">
    <div class="hud-title">
      🏛️ <span>ÇEVRE ŞEHİRCİLİK MÜDÜRLÜĞÜ</span>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Core Metrics (Bütçe, Eko, Gençlik, Başkan) -->
    <div class="hud-stats-group">
      <!-- 1: Bütçe -->
      <div class="stat-pill" title="Belediye Çevre Bütçesi">
        <div class="stat-floating-delta" id="delta-b">+0</div>
        <div class="stat-pill-header">
          <span>💰 Bütçe</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-pill-track">
          <div class="stat-pill-fill fill-b" id="bar-b" style="width: 50%;"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="stat-pill-val" id="val-b">50%</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 2: Eko-Skor -->
      <div class="stat-pill" title="COP31 İklim ve Karbon Skoru">
        <div class="stat-floating-delta" id="delta-e">+0</div>
        <div class="stat-pill-header">
          <span>🌿 Eko-Skor</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-pill-track">
          <div class="stat-pill-fill fill-e" id="bar-e" style="width: 45%;"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="stat-pill-val" id="val-e">45%</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 3: Gençlik Güveni -->
      <div class="stat-pill" title="Gençlik & Halkın Çevre İnancı">
        <div class="stat-floating-delta" id="delta-y">+0</div>
        <div class="stat-pill-header">
          <span>🎓 Gençlik</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-pill-track">
          <div class="stat-pill-fill fill-y" id="bar-y" style="width: 55%;"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="stat-pill-val" id="val-y">55%</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 4: Başkanın Güveni -->
      <div class="stat-pill" title="Belediye Başkanının Güveni">
        <div class="stat-floating-delta" id="delta-m">+0</div>
        <div class="stat-pill-header">
          <span>👔 Başkan</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-pill-track">
          <div class="stat-pill-fill fill-m" id="bar-m" style="width: 50%;"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="stat-pill-val" id="val-m">50%</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Day, Shift & Audio toggle -->
    <div class="hud-right-meta">
      <div class="badge-calendar">
        <strong id="hudDayText">📅 1. GÜN</strong> • <span id="hudShiftText">Sabah (1/4)</span>
      </div>
      <button class="sound-toggle-btn" id="btnSoundToggle">🔊 Açık</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ============================================================
       MAIN OFFICE STAGE (Exact Artwork from Designer.png)
       ============================================================ */ -->
  <main class="office-stage">
    <!-- Layer 1: Window Viewport directly aligned with the cut-out glass -->
    <div class="window-viewport">
      <!-- 5-Tier Video layer -->
      <video id="windowVideo" class="window-video-layer" autoplay loop muted playsinline>
        <source id="videoSource" src="videos/city_3.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      </video>

      <!-- Dynamic Fallback Skyline (5 Tiers) -->
      <div class="sky-backdrop" id="skyBackdrop"></div>
      <svg class="city-svg-layer" id="citySvg" viewBox="0 0 600 180" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <!-- Rendered dynamically -->
      </svg>
    </div>

    <!-- Layer 2: The Exact Office Artwork with Cut-Out Window -->
    <!-- Dual Office Artworks: Desktop vs Mobile -->
    <img src="images/office_desktop_cutout.png" alt="Makam Odası Masaüstü" class="office-artwork desktop-only">
    <img src="images/office_mobile_cutout.png" alt="Makam Odası Mobil" class="office-artwork mobile-only">

    <!-- Layer 3: Interactive Hotline Telephone sitting on the desk -->
    <div class="desk-hotline" id="hotlineContainer" title="Kırmızı Makam Telefonu (Çaldığında Tıkla)">
      <div class="phone-urgent-banner">⚠️ ACİL ÇAĞRI!</div>
      <div class="hotline-phone-icon">☎️</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Drop Zones for Swipe (Left: Ret / Right: Onay) -->
    <div class="desk-drop-zone drop-reject" id="trayReject" title="Sola Sürükle: REDDET">
      📁✕<br>RET ET
    </div>
    <div class="desk-drop-zone drop-accept" id="trayAccept" title="Sağa Sürükle: ONAYLA">
      📋✓<br>ONAYLA
    </div>

    <!-- Layer 4: The Official Dossier / Paper on the Leather Desk Mat -->
    <div class="paper-desk-slot">
      <div class="onboarding-hint" id="onboardingHint">
        <span>⬅️ Sola: Reddet</span>
        <span>Sağa: İmzala & Onayla ➡️</span>
      </div>

      <div class="official-dossier" id="activePaper">
        <div class="ink-stamp approved" id="stampApproved">✓ ONAYLANMIŞTIR • GEREĞİ YAPILA</div>
        <div class="ink-stamp rejected" id="stampRejected">✕ UYGUN GÖRÜLMEMİŞTİR</div>

        <div class="gov-memo-header">
          <div class="gov-coat-of-arms">🏛️</div>
          <div class="gov-header-title">T.C. ÇEVRE ŞEHİRCİLİK MÜDÜRLÜĞÜ</div>
          <div class="gov-header-dept">İklim Değişikliği ve Sıfır Atık Şube Müdürlüğü</div>
          <div class="petitioner-clip">
            <div class="paperclip-icon">📎</div>
            <img id="memoAvatar" src="images/zeynep.png" alt="Talep Sahibi" class="petitioner-photo">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="memo-meta-grid">
          <div>SAYI: <span id="memoNo">78241029-622-E.1042</span></div>
          <div>TARİH: <span id="memoDate">14.11.2031</span></div>
          <div>MUHATAP: <span id="memoSender">Gençlik Meclisi</span></div>
          <div>VAKİT: <span style="color:#0284c7; font-weight:800;" id="memoTimeSlot">SABAH (09:30)</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="memo-content">
          <span class="memo-subject-bold" id="memoSubject">KONU: Okul Yemekhanesi Biyogaz Pilot Tesisi</span>
          <p id="memoBody">
            "Fen Lisesi pansiyon yemekhane organik atıklarının fermantasyonuyla biyogaz elde edilmesi ve karbon salımının %30 azaltılması hedeflenmektedir. 25.000 TL ar-ge hibe tahsisini olurlarınıza arz ederim."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="memo-footer">
          <span class="barcode-strip">|||| ||| ||||||| ||| |||||</span>
          <span id="memoRisk">Maliyet: Orta • Risk: Düşük</span>
          <span>Paraf: Şb.Md. / 2031-COP</span>
        </div>

        <div class="desk-actions">
          <button class="btn-action btn-reject-paper" id="btnReject">
            ✕ Reddet (Sola)
          </button>
          <button class="btn-action btn-sign" id="btnSign">
            ✍️ İmzala & Onayla (Sağa)
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- ============================================================
       DRAMATIC POPUPS: DAY-END, BREAKING NEWS, HOTLINE, REPORT CARD
       ============================================================ */ -->
  <!-- 1: Day End Modal -->
  <div class="popup-overlay" id="dayEndModal">
    <div class="day-end-card">
      <div class="day-end-icon">🌇</div>
      <h3 class="day-end-title" id="dayEndTitle">1. GÜNÜN MESAİSİ BİTTİ</h3>
      <p class="day-end-sub" id="dayEndDesc">
        Belediye otobüsünün camına yaslanıp şehri izliyorsun. Bugün imzaladığın kararlar sokaklara yansımaya başladı.
      </p>

      <div class="day-recap-grid">
        <div class="day-recap-box">
          <div class="recap-label">Bugünkü Karar</div>
          <div class="recap-val">4 Resmi Evrak</div>
        </div>
        <div class="day-recap-box">
          <div class="recap-label">Mevcut Şehir Durumu</div>
          <div class="recap-val" id="recapCityStatus">Gelişmekte</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button class="btn-next-day" id="btnNextDay">Ertesi Günün Sabahına Başla ☀️</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 2: Breaking Newspaper Flash -->
